<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to August 1 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to August 1 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to August 16 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>					   1996/97		1995/96</p>
<p>				     16/08    01/08	16/08   01/08</p>
<p>SUGAR CANE(million tonnes)  124.17   105.41     100.41   82.40</p>
<p>SUGAR(million tonnes)	   5.41     4.48	 4.23   3.38</p>
<p>ALCOHOL(million cubic meters) 6.42     5.33	 5.19   4.17</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
